        "ref": "dsn_4410036cd22c9199b2746e05",
        "quotedText": "Before onboarding Sub-processors, Alaio conducts an audit of the security and privacy practices of Sub-processors to ensure Sub-processors provide a level of security and privacy appropriate to their access to data and the scope of the services they are engaged to provide. Once Alaio has assessed the risks presented by the Sub-processor then, subject always to the requirements set out in Section 7 the Sub-processor is required to enter into appropriate security, confidentiality and privacy contract terms.",
